# YouTube Data API v3 key — https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# Without it muscify still runs: Deezer search + charts and the full SomaFM
# radio directory work keyless, and pasted YouTube/Deezer/SoundCloud links
# resolve via oEmbed (which requires no key). Only YouTube *search* and the
# YouTube music chart need this.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=